      "source": [
        "# Keyword argument\n",
        "\n",
        "A keyword argument supplies a value by parameter name in a call, such as `print(\"hi\", end=\"!\")`. Keyword arguments can also be supplied by unpacking a mapping with `**`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-keyword-argument)"
      ]
    }
